{"name": "07_出稿与交付", "width": 1440, "height": 1080, "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 1080\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fff\" /><path d=\"M64 180L1376 180\" stroke=\"#eee\" /><path d=\"M64 1020L1376 1020\" stroke=\"#eee\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"228\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"340\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"452\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"564\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"676\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"64\" y=\"788\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4f4f4\" /><rect x=\"800\" y=\"228\" width=\"576\" height=\"330\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#fafafa\" /><rect x=\"800\" y=\"590\" width=\"576\" height=\"334\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#fafafa\" /></svg>", "texts": [{"x": 64, "y": 60, "text": "AUTOCLAW  /  DESIGN FOUNDATION", "size": 12, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 118, "text": "从规范到新设计稿", "size": 32, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 152, "text": "把可复用的基线带到下一张画板，同时保留来源、验证结果与编辑边界。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 1050, "text": "V10 · 2026-10-12  |  基于基础设计规范 V09 · 浅色桌面工作区", "size": 12, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1250, "y": 1050, "text": "07 / 07", "size": 12, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 262, "text": "01", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 250, "text": "读取基准", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 282, "text": "DESIGN.md → 规范 V09 → 当前页面类型", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 374, "text": "02", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 362, "text": "复用外壳", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 394, "text": "首页 / 对话+预览 / 对话+代码", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 486, "text": "03", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 474, "text": "复用组件与图标", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 506, "text": "先用同款组件；新增内容使用语义参数", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 598, "text": "04", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 586, "text": "补齐状态", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 618, "text": "默认、选中、禁用、加载；新增状态标为建议", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 710, "text": "05", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 698, "text": "渲染与检查", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 730, "text": "检查文字、路径、对齐、留白、层级与溢出", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 78, "y": 822, "text": "06", "size": 18, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 810, "text": "交付与版本", "size": 18, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 140, "y": 842, "text": "SVG + 预览 + 来源 + 未验证项；保留旧版", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 269, "text": "Figma 编辑边界", "size": 20, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 316, "text": "SVG 可保留分组和独立路径。", "size": 15, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 354, "text": "SVG 源码中的 text 可编辑，导入可能转轮廓。", "size": 15, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 392, "text": "需要原生文字时，使用随附本地导入工具。", "size": 15, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 430, "text": "SVG 不保存 Figma 组件实例或自动布局。", "size": 15, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 468, "text": "导入工具未实测运行；须检查字体与基线。", "size": 15, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 632, "text": "每次交付核对", "size": 20, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 678, "text": "□ 比例与逻辑像素正确，无溢出。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 713, "text": "□ 图标同款、无毛边、无错误填实。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 748, "text": "□ 文字、灰阶、选中态、投影一致。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 783, "text": "□ 主界面未整体栅格化，位图清单准确。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 818, "text": "□ 已验证与未验证内容分开说明。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 824, "y": 853, "text": "□ 新版本归档，旧版文件不覆盖。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 970, "text": "参数文件：tokens.json / tokens.css · 文本规范：AutoClaw_基础设计规范_V09.md · 已确认、执行值、建议分别记录。", "size": 12, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}]}